# Rebellious Captives: the exhaust ability is on the stack, so it resolves without its source. Bot2 kills the Captives with Lightning Bolt in
# response: the counters have nothing to go on, but the land still becomes a 2/2 land creature with haste (CR 701.66a, 608.2b).

